{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟在11月的可選更新KB5132057中，逐步向普通Windows 11電腦推出了原生WinUI 3搜索體驗。新搜索採用更緊湊的界面設計，擺脱了此前基於WebView2的舊版搜索，在測試中僅佔用約26.3MB內存，整體體驗明顯更輕量、更現代化。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587674.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:55:15.880916+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:33:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.744379+00:00","content_hash":"9a4f237c75cd42248ec1cc411ad603478d30a054f9797c0ad0b7e5ff8c62c6b4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}